Sec. 13.	Budget. All outstanding budget balances duly appropriated for the operations of DECS in the provinces within the ARMM for FY 1991 shall be turned over to the ARG as of the date transfer. Budget balances shall include appropriations for personal services of public secondary school teachers and other personnel not covered by the DECS-IBM Payroll servicing schedule, maintenance and other operating expenses, capital outlay.
