SEC. 2.	A two-tiered tariff structure of 3% and 10% for raw materials and finished products, respectively, as listed in Annex "A" hereof, shall be fully implemented by 1 January 2003. The details of such tariff structure shall be prepared and submitted to the President of the NEDA in accordance with Section 401 of the same Code.
